        {
          "speaker": "B",
          "text": "この本も、あまり好きではありません。",
          "translation": "I don’t like this book very much either."
        }
      ],
      "question": "What does B think of the first book?",
      "choices": [
        "Very interesting",
        "A little interesting",
        "Not interesting at all",
        "B has not seen it"
      ],
      "answer": 2,
      "explanation": "全然 with a negative means not at all. 面白くない is the negative of 面白い. Extra phrase: どうですか means how about it?"
